<title>USA: Missouri direct hogs steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Missouri direct hogs steady/$0.50 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>JEFFERSON CITY 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were steady to $0.50 lower compared to Monday's close. Top $53.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    51.75-53.50,</p>
<p>Sows steady. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    300-500 lbs    40.00-42.00</p>
<p>	   over 500 lbs    49.00-54.00</p>
</text>
